<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>IRELAND GOVERNMENT LIST (970608)</p>
<p> ************************************************************</p>
<p> * 8June 97 - Opposition Fianna Fail leader Bertie Ahern    *</p>
<p> * and his Progressive Democrats ally were			*</p>
<p> * assured of victory in the 6 June election		    *</p>
<p> * when they won a joint 80 seats. With only		    *</p>
<p> * three seats remaining to be counted, the		     *</p>
<p> * FF/PD held 80 seats and Prime Minister			 *</p>
<p> * Bruton's government 73, according to			   *</p>
<p> * official results.						    *</p>
<p> ************************************************************</p>
<p> President (Sworn in 3 Dec 90)..................Mary ROBINSON</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - - </p>
<p>OUTGOING THREE-PARTY COALITION GOVERNMENT</p>
<p> (Formed 15 Dec 94)</p>
<p> (See end of list for party affiliations)</p>
<p> Prime Minister(Taoiseach)...................John BRUTON (FG)</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Agriculture &amp; Forestry.......................Ivan YATES (FG)</p>
<p> Arts &amp; Culture.........................Michael HIGGINS (LAB)</p>
<p> Defence &amp; Marine...........................Sean BARRETT (FG)</p>
<p> Education............................Niamh BHREATHNACH (LAB)</p>
<p> Enterprise &amp; Employment..................Richard BRUTON (FG)</p>
<p> Environment.............................Brendan HOWLIN (LAB)</p>
<p> Equality &amp; Law Reform....................Mervyn TAYLOR (LAB)</p>
<p> Finance...................................Ruairi QUINN (LAB)</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs............................Dick SPRING (LAB)</p>
<p> Health...................................Michael NOONAN (FG)</p>
<p> Justice.......................................Nora OWEN (FG)</p>
<p> Social Welfare.......................Proinisas de ROSSA (DL)</p>
<p> Tourism, Trade...............................Enda KENNY (FG)</p>
<p> Transport, Energy, Communications............Alan DUKES (FG)</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS</p>
<p> FG - Fine Gael</p>
<p> LAB - Labour</p>
<p> DL - Democratic Left</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>Parliament Speaker................................Sean TREACY</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>Central Bank Governor.......................Maurice O'CONNELL</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>	 NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		 government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		 Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		 7968.</p>
<p>			(End Government List)</p>
</text>
